{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《Flip Clock》是一款買斷制的桌面與床頭翻頁時鐘，無需訂閱、沒有廣告，也不用建立帳號。把 iPhone 或 iPad 立在書桌或床頭櫃上，它便成為可從房間另一端清楚閱讀的翻牌式時鐘，具備真實機械翻頁、22 款錶面與真正能睡得著的夜間模式。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，適合想要一個安靜、乾淨、長時間開著也不打擾的時鐘的人。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-195.webp\">\n<h2>真實機械翻頁與夜間模式</h2>\n<p>《Flip Clock》以兩階段摺疊的翻頁動畫呈現時間，卡片繞摺線翻轉後順勢落下，內建 22 款錶面與 5 種數字字體。長時間運行亦經考慮，具備防烙印位移、純黑夜間模式與入夜轉紅的暖色顯示。系統級鬧鐘可穿透靜音與專注模式，於鎖定畫面全螢幕響鬧，並支援重複日與自訂貪睡時間；另備離線世界時鐘與專注計時器，需 iOS 26。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-223-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-224-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-225-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-226-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-227-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-228-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Flip Clock: Desk &amp; Alarm Clock</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T14:39:30.169042+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":408,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T14:32:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T04:17:34.309163+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T14:38:03.221509+00:00","content_hash":"6870179da173ed19922ebb686e9d12449fdb3f0f28e9782eed2bfae9b157a56a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}